-- Relationship hops (ex8). Twin of 08-relationship-hops.bqn.
-- rel.Comp is one guarded indexed gather; -1 marks the absent link and the clamped read of row 0's data is dead weight the guard must mask out. Rows 1 and 4 have no mentor: gold rows 1, 4 staying 0 is the .bqn's left-join-null witness (row 1's clamped gather sees twoHanded 90 > 80). faction is total, gathered unguarded; rows 0..1 double as faction entities. Row 5's mentor (1) is alive, so it keeps Mentored.
--! registry ../registries/08-relationship-hops.reg
--! expect gold = 1000 0 1000 1000 0 0
--! expect mentored = 0 0 0 0 0 1
--! expect morale = 100 100 80 100 80 100

Nord & faction.TwoHanded > 80 , Gold += 1000
